---
import LocalImage from "../common/LocalImage.astro";
---

<section id="soundtracks" class="soundtracks" aria-labelledby="soundtracks-title">
    <div class="section-shell soundtracks-grid">
    <div class="soundtracks-heading">
      <LocalImage class="soundtracks-chef-hat" src="/images/polaroids/sombrero_chef.png" alt="" width={1254} height={1254} ariaHidden />
      <div class="section-label section-label--light">02 / EL MENU COMPLETO</div>
      <h2 id="soundtracks-title" class="display-title display-title--light reveal">SOUND<br />TRACKS.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="soundtracks-copy reveal">
      <p>Escucha los dieciseis platos antes de elegir tu favorito.</p>
      <ol class="phase-list">
        <li><span>01</span> NO PODEMOS SER AMIGOS</li><li><span>02</span> PIENSO EN TI</li><li><span>03</span> INAROW62.</li><li><span>04</span> EN LA MISMA CIUDAD</li>
      </ol>
      <iframe title="OMAKASE por Álvaro Díaz en Spotify" class="spotify-embed" style="border-radius:12px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/album/79TuXcubVSnQDvvvzEbIY2?utm_source=generator&theme=0&si=3f51529097f74aea" width="100%" height="352" allowfullscreen allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
